The code under Mac/ is bg3mse, a macOS port of Norbyte's Script Extender for
Baldur's Gate 3.

It is licensed under the terms below, which are the Script Extender's own
(LICENSE at the root of this repository): the MIT License with the Commons
Clause condition. Two parts have terms of their own:

- Mac/Platform, the platform layer, and the version stamp (Mac/Release/Version.h
  and the Version.cpp generated from Mac/Release/Configure.cmake) are under the
  MIT License alone, see Mac/Platform/LICENSE. The camera module is built with
  them.
- Mac/Camera, the camera module, is under GPL-3.0-or-later with the exceptions
  in Mac/Camera/EXCEPTIONS, see Mac/Camera/LICENSE.


